   "analysis": "<p><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">上田秋将在新节目里演出自己从来没演过的角色。大家觉得他</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">是不是在</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">为</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">演绎</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">角色而</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">烦恼呢</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">，但据说并没有。</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">正确排序：</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">4132</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">知识点：</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">「</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">と思いきや</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">」</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">，原以为</span>……（实际上）却。</span></p><p><br/></p>",
